  m_Name: Ignis
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlayerSpells
  spellName: Ignis
  keyword: Ignis
  description: 'Spell Name: Ignis

    

    Incantation Word: Ignis

    

    "Fire
    has never been cruel. It only reveals what was never meant to endure. Within
    every flame lies the memory of creation and destruction, a reminder that warmth
    can shelter the innocent while embers consume the forgotten. Those who call upon
    Ignis do not command the fire, they ask it to awaken."'
